WEBVTT

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:45.000
<b>There was something money couldn't buy</b>

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.410
Yo!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.590
Good night!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:52.630
It's morning!

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.340
Himekawa Tatsuya...

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.950
One of Ishiyama's TKKH and the son 
of the head of the Himekawa Group,

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.570
he lives by the motto "There ain't nothin' 
that can't be controlled by money."

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.450
Himekawa-san, the thing you asked for.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.350
Ah, I see.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:27.660
Good work.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.840
But lately, he's been in a fierce battle 
with one who won't be swayed by money.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.100
Ah, yes.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.980
That's the way. Get around 
20 people, that should do.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.230
Don't worry, I'll pay.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:50.270
I might have gotten beat by 
that bullishly honest dolt,

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.310
but not this time...

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:58.940
I'll work behind the scenes, find out 
your weakness, make careful preparations,

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:02.150
and this time for sure, 
box you into a corner!

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:07.240
I have something you don't that 
decides everything in the end...

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:11.680
That's right! The ultimate 
weapon called money!

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:17.910
Oga! I'll send you to the pits of hell, 
so you can never make a fool of me again!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.010
<b>School Shop</b>

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.930
Hungry, Baby Beel?

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:27.890
Not yet(mada), then? I see...

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.830
Lady!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.280
Right, that'll be 150 yen.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.650
Huh? Where's the usual lady?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:39.830
Oh... Sato-san's caught a cold today.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.080
I'm her replacement.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.190
So you <i>are</i> hungry?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:49.830
Sheesh, fine then...

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.690
The shop lady's sick?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.660
A cold that can take her 
out's somethin' serious.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.810
Lucky you. "Stupid people never catch colds."

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:01.950
I'm not stupid! I'm the 
Strategist, remember?!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.450
I've worked my magic behind the 
scenes at the school shop...

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:09.800
I needed the lady to stay 
quiet for a little while.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.310
Now bite into my trap, Oga!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:17.090
There's all kinds of stuff you ain't 
never supposed to eat in that sandwich!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.740
I don't care what you are, Oga,

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.450
ain't no one that can withstand an 
attack from inside your stomach!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:32.780
Hey.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.290
You forgot the master's lunch.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.540
What?!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.430
Oh, my bad.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.300
And your lunch as well, knave.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.410
My lunch?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.550
I've been told to make you eat 
food from the Demon World.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.600
Huh?

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.990
This is a Macao-style lunch I 
made together with Hilda-chan.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.970
(Lunch from your love! Ufu *heart* )

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.250
"Ufu" my ass!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.820
This is really creepy, damn her!

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.240
What?!

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:04.820
Damn you, Oga's wife!

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:05.720
Man, I'm jealous! A lunch 
made special by Hilda-san!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.920
You want it?

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.790
What? Seriously?

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.450
Hilda-san, can I?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.330
Suit yourself, Annoichi.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.510
Sure. I already bought a sandwich.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.040
Here you go, Annoichi.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.840
Don't mind if I do!

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:23.590
Good job, Annoichi!

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.550
This is Hilda-san's handmade lunch!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.600
It's a lunch of love!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.880
I depart now, my cute wife, Hilda.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.850
So long too, Akbaba Jr.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.790
W-Wait!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.860
Furuichi-san, here's your lunch!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:45.730
Now now, Hilda... I've told you to 
call me Takayuki-chan, remember?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.020
You silly thing.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:52.400
I put in your favorite 
fried egg, Takayuki-chan!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.500
Well, I'll look forward to it.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.770
You're so cute, Hilda...

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.380
I love you... *smooch*

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.780
Furuichi, you're makin' a Demon quiver...

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.310
Y-You disgust me.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:12.350
O-Oga... You can hear what I'm thinking?!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.340
Sure, since you said it all out loud.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.080
Anyway, thanks for the food!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.890
I figured.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:30.870
What'd you put in there today?

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.570
Fried pieces of silky Demon manjuuheel,

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:37.030
stewed Demon eel-mushroom,

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.500
and Demon black widow 
omelet with green onions.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:44.560
Are you trying to kill me or something?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.230
Here, master...

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.430
Man...

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.020
Okay, all filled up!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.100
How's the taste of the 
Demon World, Furuichi-kun?

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.890
Why? Why isn't he suffering?

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.510
You actually ate this stuff?

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:07.940
And thanks to it, my stomach's 
stronger than ever!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.640
That stomach of yours ain't normal, man!

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.780
Whatever... On to the next plan.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.950
Himekawa...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.830
What the hell have you done?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:32.360
Ishiyama Market Street.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.700
What's this?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.200
There's a ton of costumed 
animal characters...

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.720
He'll actually pay us that bonus, right?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:46.340
That's right! Whoever catches Oga's 
brat gets their pay plus a bonus!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.910
I'll catch him, even if it costs me my life!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.140
Mr. Rabbit!

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.330
Mr. Bear!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.830
Mr. Kappa!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.180
Shoo!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.090
Seriously.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.500
You're so not a cute baby.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.370
You wanna go, buddy?

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.920
It's Gohan-kun!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.300
You know who that is!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.920
You know... that!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.360
<b>Eat Rice!</b>

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:29.650
The world-renown shounen 
manga even you read...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.930
The immortal, legendary work that's 
passed its 50th anniversary!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:37.960
With an anime that gets TV ratings higher than 
20%... Truly Japan's national treasure, Gohan-kun!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:41.750
Said to be nothing else like it 
ever created in the entire world...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.070
Why would a costumed character of Gohan-kun 
be here in Ishiyama Market Street?!

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:54.800
Oga... My target is that 
baby stuck to your back.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:09:00.490
If I could take that baby hostage, 
even you wouldn't be able to act!

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.710
I don't care if you call this underhanded...

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.060
I'll use whatever methods I can!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.450
That's right! Take the bait!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.390
While the baby is distracted 
by the character...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.660
A pen, a pen! Where'd I put it?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.900
That damn Gohan-kun...

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.140
He found them first!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.390
Hold it, Gohan! Wait 
right there, you bastard!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:51.400
This way, Gohan-kun! Your autograph, please!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.370
Oga...

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.840
Explosive Uppercut!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:13.090
Oga! What the hell have you done?!

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.620
He was a fake.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:20.160
The real one's chopsticks 
are red on the ends.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.680
But his were yellow.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.480
Man, he don't spare anyone.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.790
Damn, I underestimated him.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.200
I still have more plans...

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.560
Two fist croquette, please.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.380
I'll have one.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.630
Sure thing.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.080
Here you go, fresh out of the fryer.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:57.060
Hot!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.550
We'll wait for them to 
cool, so hold on a sec.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.270
Hey, young lad.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.350
That baby is so cute...

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:20.210
May I hold him for a moment?

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:25.200
If you let me, then next, I'll hold 
you, my strapping young man...

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.660
Y-Y-Y-You'll hold me?!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:33.270
The previous two plans failed, 
but this one's foolproof!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:38.050
A dynamite body even better than Oga's 
wife, overflowing with maternal instinct!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.850
A baby can't help but 
be completely entranced!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.600
Ma'am!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.020
Furuichi-dono!

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:16.200
Even though you have me, you would obsess 
over such an odd creature as this?!

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:18.880
Stop, please!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.940
For god's sake please stop showing 
up out of the blue like that!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:26.210
And hey, that's rude calling 
her an odd creature!

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:29.680
Then look at this!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.430
It's a delinquent dressed up like a lady!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.690
Too bad we were found out.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:40.440
I guess we'll just crush 
everyone at once then!

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:44.710
Since it has come to this, Furuichi-dono, 
enter my body once again!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.070
Comeback Salmon!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.170
What the...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.820
Transfer.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.370
We should be able to eat 'em soon.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.520
Ah, well.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.990
Hey, lady! Give us two that 
aren't just out of the fryer!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.410
Why me, too?!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.380
Now, let us return home, Furuichi-dono!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.710
Transfer!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:59.400
Whoa, there... What the hell is this...

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.120
<b>Remaining Balance: 0 yen</b>

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.120
I'm out of money.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:15.570
I've never been out of money my entire life.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:18.970
Maybe I did use a little too much...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.530
<b>Allowance: 10,000,000 yen.</b>

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.530
Information Gathering: 10,000 yen.

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.070
The fees for the extras 
this episode: 300,000 yen.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.980
Store Lady double: 30,000 yen.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.360
Costume Character Setup: 4,200,000 yen.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.590
Plus the pay for the performers 
inside: 250,000 yen.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.810
The pay for the guy dressed 
up as a girl: 30,000 yen.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.420
Cost of escape from deserted 
island: 5,000,000 yen.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.520
Plus miscellaneous expenses: 180,000 yen.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.640
<b>Remaining Allowance: 0 yen</b>

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:41.150
Until I get my allowance next month I'm 
gonna have to get by with no money!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.480
This is all that damn Oga's fault...

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:48.700
Screw him! I'll never forgive this!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.830
Perfect timing.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.080
You, go to Oga and...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.580
Sorry about this, Himekawa-san, 
but can you pay up front?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.170
What did you say?!

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.080
Well, I've been thinking a lot, see...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.860
I really need to think more about 
compliance and risk management issues.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:10.490
This is a dangerous bridge to cross, so 
considering the actuality of risk, a PDC cycle would...

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:11.290
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.350
Well, not like I was planning 
on hiring you anyway!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.210
Crap...

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.070
Hey, you!

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:19.500
Oh, Himekawa-san...

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.850
You, there! Go to Oga and...

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:24.340
Hell, no, man.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:28.820
I'm so scared of the old lady at the 
shop that I can't buy from her anymore!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.740
What am I supposed to do for 
lunch until I graduate now?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.460
You're annoying. Why don't 
you just order delivery?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.760
Sure thing. Right after 
you hand me cash for it.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.940
Sheesh, they're all such...

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.130
Hey, Hime-chan.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.190
Whatcha doin' here?

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.000
It's rare to see you alone.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.480
Oh, shut up.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:53.080
So, why do you guys follow 
an idiot like Kanzaki?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.330
It's a long story.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.320
This isn't the place to tell you.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:04.730
I've decided to stick with 
him, no matter what happens...

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:09.250
What about you, Natsume?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.540
A guy like you doesn't have to 
follow someone like Kanzaki...

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.910
For me, it's because I find it amusing.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.910
I want to be wherever is 
most interesting to me.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.330
Kanzaki-kun is really active, so it's fun.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.790
Some extra activity, and you'll 
be more fun too, Hime-chan.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:34.050
If there is ever a time you feel you've lost 
your way, you must ask your heart once more...

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:36.800
Now, Shiro-chan, we need 
to go buy that yogurty.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:42.840
So, should I just go crush Oga myself, then?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:49.190
But, I don't have any money.

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:50.930
So for now...

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:55.310
I'll throw everything I got left at 
him! Even Oga wouldn't be able to...

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:14.340
Well, Oga's stomach is bearishly 
strong, after all...

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.530
I think I'll quit while I'm ahead.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.930
Didn't you see? I was in big trouble!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.560
Here they come...

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:30.640
Okay. If it hadn't been for them 
noticing this small difference...

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.070
This time, I'll get that baby!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.710
Explosive Uppercut!

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:00.540
Hey, two cooled fist croquette, please.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.060
I'll take one.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:06.650
You two come every day. Thanks a bunch.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:09.020
Here. These are cooled down.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.440
T-This time...

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.250
I still got this left!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:23.120
That damn Oga... We're gonna bust him up good!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:27.620
Don't feel you gotta hold 
back! We're all his victims!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.340
Who the hell are you?!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:39.300
Hey, you. What the hell do you think 
you're trying to do on Ishiyama's turf?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.020
H-Himekawa!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:42.270
Crap...

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.420
What? You alone?

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:48.930
Where's the posse you 
always have with you, huh?

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:51.130
They run away, eh?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.840
Your pals all ditched you, huh?

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.620
What a loser!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:01.870
How 'bout you join our team, Himekawa-san?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.240
Well, he can't do nothin' by himself.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.920
That might be true.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:13.710
But I'm not a member of the TKKH 
just from the power of money alone.

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:18.880
Why, you...

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.090
Take that!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:37.820
This is what you get for buttin' 
your head in where it don't belong!

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.140
Die, all of you!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.070
Damn him...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.810
You bastard...

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:05.350
This bazooka was for our 
anti-Oga plan, but too bad...

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:11.240
This is Oga's job... It 
ain't my style, damn it!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:19.940
What was that?

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.630
Yo. You awake?

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.170
Have a drink?

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:42.170
I don't feel like drinkin' your backwash.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.240
The vending machine broke, so two came out.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.310
I was just gonna throw it out anyway.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.860
This is why you weren't raised right...

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.320
Don't waste food, you!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.590
Oh, yeah?

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.570
I think you'd make me a 
pretty nice trash bin.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:05.980
This ain't bad.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:07.430
See?

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.600
Go buy me some every day.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:13.580
How about you apologize for 
gettin' a big head, huh?

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:18.590
Why don't we just find out 
who should be apologizin'?

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.860
Oh, yeah?!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.050
Nothing's happened lately, you know?

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.980
Well, as long as you can call 
picking up a baby Demon Lord,

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:29.130
having a demon maidservent show up,

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:34.870
and having a burly transference 
demon squat at my house "nothing".

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:39.270
Baby Beel, let's go buy one more croquette.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.850
You guys are real gluttons!

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:20.850
I don't like bein' in anyone's debt.

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:25.050
For you, penniless little fellow, 
a one year's supply of yogurty.

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:28.550
What the hell is this?!

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:39.600
Kanzaki-kun, all of these have expiration 
dates a month from now, so please be careful.

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.380
Why, you...

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:44.110
Natsume, Shiroyama... Do something!

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:46.460
Let me outta here!

00:24:03.450 --> 00:24:06.600
Baby Beel's crying so loud 
at night, I can't sleep!

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.910
Then we'll use a home remedy!

00:24:08.910 --> 00:24:11.460
Drink a glass of water 
while holding your nose!

00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:13.410
That's how to stop hiccups!

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:21.060
On the next Beelzebub: I 
won't let you sleep tonight!

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:25.530
Then should I go with the old standby of 
counting camel crickets jumping over a fence?!

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:27.990
Camel crickets? Scary!
